          <tr><td>Cached input</td><td>$0.10</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cache writes (30 minutes)</td><td>$2.50</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Output</td><td>$10.00</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>These are short-context Standard rates from the API model page [2]. Batch costs 50% of Standard rates, and Fast mode costs twice the Standard rate for the same context length [2].</p>
